I restructured the common unresolved-type path to fall through and used branch hints plus a local profile pointer to reduce repeated member loads. The logic and return values are unchanged.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    FIT_UINT8 t = type;
    if (__builtin_expect(t == FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1))
    {
        auto p = profile;
        if (__builtin_expect((p != NULL) && (profileIndex < p->numFields), 1))
            t = p->fields[profileIndex].type;
    }
    return t;
}
```